| Build — compile and link the HostFSFiler module with the DDE.
| Produces <Obey$Dir>.HostFSFiler,ffa.  Run after SetDDE.
Set HFiler$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Dir <Obey$Dir>
cc -c -zM -zps1 -ffah -IC: -o o.hostfsfiler c.hostfsfiler
cmhg cmhg.HostFSFiler -o o.head
link -rmf -o HostFSFiler,ffa o.head o.hostfsfiler C:o.stubs
Echo Built <HFiler$Dir>.HostFSFiler,ffa
